'''Gold Icebreaker''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player that finished '''1st''' on the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]] Coin-Collecting Leaderboard.

==Appearance==
Gold Icebreaker takes a similar shape to the [[BattleAxe]], but larger. It has a thin, long brown handle with a sharp golden knob at the bottom. The axe appears to be a labrys with two blades encased in golden ice. It has a dark demon-like face in the middle with golden horns, golden eyes, a thin, black nose, and sharp golden teeth.

==Trivia==
*During the [[Christmas Event 2020|2020 Christmas Event]], there were 2 different leaderboards, Gift-Giving and Coin-Collecting.
*In order to obtain this item, participants collect as many [[Snow Tokens|winter tokens]] (act exactly like coins) in order to score points which will determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Bronze Icebreaker]], [[Silver Icebreaker]], and [[Red Icebreaker]].
*Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this item is '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/79081218/profile HippocriticaI]'''.

